# Instance with overlapping patterns (disjointness violation)
# Two arms with the same pattern [a@Int] should trigger an overlap error
[
  # Define a simple class
  TestClass: [class [TestClass a]
    m: [Fn@Bool [a]]]

  # Define overlapping instances - both arms match Int
  TestClassInst: [instance TestClass
    [pattern [a@Int]]: [m: [fn [x] true]]
    [pattern [a@Int]]: [m: [fn [x] false]]]

  result: 42
]

---

%.result
=== out
overlapping instance patterns
